---
---

<section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-alt);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header centered">
      <div class="badge-pill mint" style="margin: 0 auto 16px auto;">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span>Institutional Synergy</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="heading-2">
        The Partner Ecosystem Behind Vrosk Energies
      </h2>
      <p class="body-lead" style="max-width: 680px; margin: 14px auto 0 auto;">
        Our competitive advantage is deeply anchored by strategic partnerships across inter-dealer capital markets, licensed alternative asset management, and international investment syndicates.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Outgriid 3-Column Bento Grid for Partners -->
    <div class="bento-grid-3">
      <!-- Partner 1: Krosk Partners Limited -->
      <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <span class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; background: rgba(77,255,176,0.15); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
              Capital Markets
            </span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">EST. 2015</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Krosk Partners Limited
          </h3>
          <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
            A premier Nigerian inter-dealer brokerage firm acting as accredited intermediaries to facilitate high-volume trade executions in fixed income securities, sovereign bonds, and treasury instruments.
          </p>
          <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">
            <strong>Strategic Synergy:</strong> Provides Vrosk with real-time interest rate hedging, liquidity origination, and institutional treasury execution.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08);">
          <a href="/krosk-partners-limited" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 0.875rem;">
            Explore Partnership Profile →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Partner 2: Zrosk Investment Management -->
      <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <span class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; background: rgba(77,255,176,0.15); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
              Asset Management
            </span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">$150M+ AUM</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Zrosk Investment Management
          </h3>
          <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
            An SEC-licensed alternative investment manager deploying capital across 4 distinct verticals: venture capital, private credit, strategic enterprise investments, and proprietary trading.
          </p>
          <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">
            <strong>Strategic Synergy:</strong> Unlocks tailored project debt structures, inventory financing, and mezzanine capital for terminal storage acquisitions.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08);">
          <a href="/zrosk" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 0.875rem;">
            Explore Partnership Profile →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Partner 3: Trosk Dubai Group -->
      <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <span class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; background: rgba(77,255,176,0.15); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
              Global Investor
            </span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">$200M+ Portfolio</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Trosk Dubai Group
          </h3>
          <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
            A Dubai-based registered conglomerate holding a robust investment portfolio across oil & gas, physical commodities, finance, and industrial manufacturing in West Africa and internationally.
          </p>
          <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">
            <strong>Strategic Synergy:</strong> The parent foundation of Vrosk Energies, providing international credit backing and global trader counterpart relationships.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08);">
          <a href="/trosk" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 0.875rem;">
            Explore Partnership Profile →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
